{
  "info": {
    "name": "Integriq — MCP tool servers behind the gateway (gateway-mcp-proxy)",
    "description": "Newman test of openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-25-gateway-mcp-proxy (REQ-MCPX-001..003): an endpoint of target type `mcp` puts an outside MCP tool server behind the gateway.\n\n- REQ-MCPX-001: a call without the endpoint's key, or with a wrong one, is refused; a call with it reaches the tool server under the source location, carries the session headers (never the caller's key) and answers the tool server's own status, headers and body; an event stream comes back as events.\n- REQ-MCPX-002: the call log names the JSON-RPC method and the tool, and holds no tool arguments.\n- REQ-MCPX-003: a tool limited to 2 calls a minute answers its third call with 429 and a JSON-RPC error naming the tool (not a problem document); another tool still passes.\n\nThe tool server is tests/mocks/mcp/server.py (`python3 tests/mocks/mcp/server.py`, port 8091); point `mcpUpstream` at it. Without it the relay checks are reported as skipped, not passed, and only the authentication and limit checks run. The per-tool limit is counted in the distributed cache: on an instance without one (no Redis or Memcached) the third call is not refused and the limit checks are reported as skipped. Setup creates an API key rule, a source and the endpoint through OpenRegister; teardown deletes them.\n\nSPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2\nSPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Conduction B.V. <info@conduction.nl>",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "mcpUpstream",
      "value": "http://localhost:8091"
    },
    {
      "key": "noAuthBase",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "mcpKey",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "mcpEndpointPath",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "mcpRuleUuid",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "mcpSourceUuid",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "mcpEndpointUuid",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "mcpUp",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "mcpLimited",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Setup (via OpenRegister)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create the API key rule",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// A fresh key and path per run, so a run never meets what an earlier run left behind.",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('mcpKey', 'newman-mcp-' + Date.now() + '-' + Math.floor(Math.random() * 1e6));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('mcpEndpointPath', 'mcp/newman-' + Date.now());",
                  "// Calls without a key go to another host alias, so the session cookie of the",
                  "// signed-in setup requests (host-scoped) is never sent with them. An environment",
                  "// value of noAuthBase wins over this one.",
                  "const base = pm.variables.get('base_url');",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('noAuthBase', base.includes('localhost') ? base.replace('localhost', '127.0.0.1') : base.replace('127.0.0.1', 'localhost'));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Setup: rule created', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('mcpRuleUuid', body.id || (body['@self'] || {}).id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "OCS-APIRequest",
                "value": "true"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/integriq/rule",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"name\":\"newman-mcp-key\",\"action\":\"post\",\"timing\":\"before\",\"type\":\"authentication\",\"conditions\":{},\"order\":1,\"configuration\":{\"authentication\":{\"type\":\"apikey\",\"header\":\"Authorization\",\"keys\":{\"{{mcpKey}}\":\"{{admin_user}}\"}}}}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create the tool server source",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Setup: source created', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('mcpSourceUuid', body.id || (body['@self'] || {}).id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "OCS-APIRequest",
                "value": "true"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/integriq/source",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"name\":\"newman-mcp-tool-server\",\"type\":\"api\",\"location\":\"{{mcpUpstream}}\",\"isEnabled\":true,\"auth\":\"none\"}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create the mcp endpoint, search limited to 2 a minute",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Setup: endpoint created', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('mcpEndpointUuid', body.id || (body['@self'] || {}).id);",
                  "pm.test('Setup: the endpoint is an mcp endpoint', () => pm.expect(body.targetType).to.eql('mcp'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "OCS-APIRequest",
                "value": "true"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/index.php/apps/openregister/api/objects/integriq/endpoint",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "{{admin_user}}",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{admin_password}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"name\":\"newman-mcp-endpoint\",\"endpoint\":\"{{mcpEndpointPath}}\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"targetType\":\"mcp\",\"targetId\":\"{{mcpSourceUuid}}\",\"isEnabled\":true,\"rules\":[\"{{mcpRuleUuid}}\"],\"mcpToolLimits\":{\"search\":{\"limit\":2,\"window\":60}}}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
